<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>In Bearbeitung</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            background: #f5f7fa;
        }

        .maintenance {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .maintenance h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            animation: blink 1.5s infinite;
        }

        .maintenance p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #666;
        }

        @keyframes blink {
            0%,100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.4; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="maintenance">
        <h1>🚧 In Bearbeitung 🚧</h1>
        <p>Wir arbeiten gerade an dieser Webseite.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
